#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the ssh client on each poller that reads nodes."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya kuklayenti ye-ssh ku-poller ngayinye efunda amanodi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Client"
msgstr "Iklayenti ye-SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele, ku-poller ngayinye efunda amanodi, eya kukhiye oyimfihlo ogamu yawo womphakathi inodi ngalinye eliwufaka ku-authorized_keys ngomyalo ophoqelelwe osebenzisa i-pfs-read.sh. Ifundeka kuphela ngumsebenzisi we-poller. I-plugin ayisoze yayidala, yayikopisha, noma yayiphrinta."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Ifayela Lokhiye we-SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya kufayela le-known_hosts eliphethe ukhiye wehosti wenodi ngalinye ngaphansi kwegama le-endpoint yenodi. Inodi elinokhiye oshodayo noma oshintshile alifundwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
