#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Ukuphela Kwesikhathi Sokuxhuma"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Imizuzwana yokulinda inodi ukuthi lamukele ukuxhumeka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Ukuphela Kwesikhathi Sokufunda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Imizuzwana ukufundwa kwenodi elilodwa okungayithatha isiyonke ngaphambi kokuba kumiswe futhi kuqoshwe njengokwehlulekile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Ama-KiB inodi elilodwa elingawabuyisela. Impendulo enkulu iyalahlwa futhi iqoshwe njengehlulekile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Impendulo Enkulu Kakhulu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Isifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Isabelomali Sesikhathi Sesifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Imizuzwana ukusebenza okukodwa kwesifundi okungayichitha ngaphambi kokuba kuyeke ukuqala ukufundwa kwamanodi. Kugcine ngaphansi kwesikhawu se-poller; amanodi angafundwanga afundwa ekusebenzeni okulandelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Ukufunda Ngesikhathi Esisodwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Ukufundwa kwamanodi isifundi esisodwa esikwenza ngesikhathi esisodwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina Amathebula E-plugin Uma Ukhipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Uma ikhethiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kugcina izinhlelo zayo zamafayela, amanodi, uhlu lwezinto, nenqolobane. Yisuse ukuze ukukhipha kuzisuse; thekelisa irejista kuqala ekhasini loMphathi we-Parallel Filesystem. Amanodi okugcina awathintwa nanoma iyiphi indlela."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Susa Amadivayisi Adalwe Yile Plugin Uma Ikhishwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Uma ikhethiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kususa amadivayisi ewadalele izinhlelo zamafayela, kanye namagrafu awo nemithombo yedatha, njengoba ukuzisusa ku-Cacti bekungakwenza. Amadivayisi akhona abehlotshaniswe nohlelo lwamafayela awasoze asuswa. Amafayela e-RRD asuswa kuphela uma isilungiselelo sika-Cacti sokuhlanza ama-RRD siwasusa. Uma ingakhethiwe, amadivayisi ayasala."

