msgstr "Inodi lilondoloziwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Inodi lisusiwe. Amathagethi elawabikile agcina umlando wawo."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Faka inethiwekhi njengekheli nobude besiqalo, isibonelo 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Ayikho idivayisi eyengeziwe: uhlelo lwamafayela seluvele lunayo eyodwa, noma amathempulethi awafakiwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Idivayisi ayikwazanga ukuhlotshaniswa. Kungenzeka ihlotshaniswe nolunye uhlelo lwamafayela."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Idivayisi ihlotshanisiwe futhi imibuzo yedatha namagrafu okubuka konke kwengeziwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "I-Cacti ayiyidalanga idivayisi. Bheka ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Idivayisi, imibuzo yayo yedatha, namagrafu ayo okubuka konke kudalwe."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Idivayisi ayisahlotshanisiwe. Yona namagrafu ayo kugcinwe; imibuzo yayo yedatha ayibali amathagethi kuze kube ihlotshaniswa futhi."

